 A D-Bus service for the Apertium machine translation
 system, allows Apertium to be used for machine translation for
 any installed language pair from inside any programming
 language which has D-Bus bindings.
 .
 To use this service you need the Apertium engine
 installed, and at least one linguistic package or
 language pair.
