MD5sum: 7ddf03d06a3301e687b850c111205c16
SHA1: 4082d3ad5a719c557c369d8f04746e78de982ca1
SHA256: f3b758dce36a3790f6d730a8f5b5ee2ea4a8e9acbbf8aeb4e3b456fcccb33b0e
Description: Various extra plugins for audacious
 Audacious is a fork of beep-media-player which supports winamp skins
 and many codecs.
 .
 In the default install, the following codecs are supported:
 .
  * MP3
  * Ogg Vorbis
  * AAC and AAC+
  * FLAC
  * Windows Media (WMA)
  * Musepack
  * TTA
  * Many module formats and much more!
 .
 Additionally, Audacious is extendable through plugins, and contains
 other useful features like LIRC support and support for last.fm.
 .
 This package contains extra plugins for Audacious, which may not be
 as well tested, which provide the following features:
  * Various effects like "Voice Removal"
  * LIRC support
  * AudioScrobbler support (Last.fm)
  * Audio codecs, including MIDI, Musepack (mpc), and Wavepack
  * Other outputs, including ARTS, Esound, PulseAudio and JACK
  * Visualizations
  * Other plugins like the Alarm plugin.
Homepage: http://www.audacious-media-player.org/
Tag: role::plugin, works-with::audio

