Package: cedar-backup2
Priority: optional
Section: admin
Installed-Size: 1280
Maintainer: Kenneth J. Pronovici <pronovic@debian.org>
Architecture: all
Version: 2.18.0-1
Depends: python (>= 2.3), python-support (>= 0.7.1)
Recommends: dvd+rw-tools, cdrecord, mkisofs, eject, ssh, cedar-backup2-doc
Suggests: subversion, mysql-client, postgresql-client, grepmail, gnupg
