MD5sum: 347dedd2ae5b072160b69e40711d38a3
SHA1: b0f5c647eab2e5b9383cb3f7a4505983d7a99c0a
SHA256: 6f22631d615bd460d21df18d7b07eeff338f7d4f0af892968b2d2a7186497b23
Description: Berkeley v4.5 Database Utilities
 This package provides different tools for manipulating databases
 in the Berkeley v4.5 database format, and includes:
  - db4.5_archive: write the pathnames of the log files no longer in use.
  - db4.5_checkpoint: daemon process to monitor the database log and
    checkpoint it periodically.
  - db4.5_deadlock: traverse the database environment lock region and
    abort lock requests when a deadlock is detected.
  - db4.5_load: loads (and creates) a database from standard input.
  - db4.5_dump: read a database file and write it in a format understood by
  - db4.5_printlog: dump log files in human readable format.
  - db4.5_stat: display statistics for Berkeley DB environments.
  - db4.5_upgrade: upgrades the version of files and the databases they
    contain.
  - db4.5_verify: check the structure of files and their databases.
Tag: role::program, scope::utility, works-with::db

