Package: docbook
Priority: optional
Section: text
Installed-Size: 3024
Maintainer: Debian XML/SGML Group <debian-xml-sgml-pkgs@lists.alioth.debian.org>
Architecture: all
Version: 4.5-4
Depends: sgml-data (>= 1.5.0), sgml-base (>= 1.17)
