 GNOME desktop environment (applications, Evolution contacts, Firefox
 bookmarks, files, artists and albums in Rhythmbox, Pidgin buddies,
 etc.) and perform commonly used actions on those items (Run, Open,
 Email, Chat, Play, etc.).
 .
