Description: utility for creating multi-layered backgrounds in X11
 Habak is an utility which allows you to create X Window backgrounds
 assembled from so called Habaks. Habaks could be images, texts or some
 internal functions.
 .
 Habak uses layered model. The lowest one is completely black screen. You
 can put other objects on it. Final wallpaper is usually made by combining
 one or more objects (called habaks). Order of defining habaks in command
 line is also order of putting them on stack, so the last one on the command
 line is drawn over all of the previous habaks.
