 .
  * Inspect and edit HTML
  * Tweak CSS to perfection
  * Visualize CSS metrics
  * Monitor network activity
  * Debug and profile JavaScript
  * Quickly find errors
  * Explore the DOM
  * Execute JavaScript on the fly
