Package: ifplugd
Priority: optional
Section: net
Installed-Size: 320
Maintainer: Y Giridhar Appaji Nag <giridhar@appaji.net>
Architecture: i386
Version: 0.28-12
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.7-1), libdaemon0 (>= 0.11), debconf (>= 1.2.0) | debconf-2.0
