Installed-Size: 1412
Maintainer: Paul Slootman <paul@debian.org>
Architecture: i386
Source: isdnutils
Version: 1:3.9.20060704-3.6
Replaces: isdnutils (<< 1:3.1pre1b-0)
Depends: isdnutils-base (= 1:3.9.20060704-3.6), isdnlog-data (>= 1:3.9.20060704-3.6), debconf (>= 1.2.9) | debconf-2.0, libc6 (>= 2.7-1)
Filename: pool/main/i/isdnutils/isdnlog_3.9.20060704-3.6_i386.deb
Size: 510166
MD5sum: d7434d7876b2ef4348498f440fb01848
