 multilingual text on Linux framebuffer.  It can display ISO-2022
 text such as ISO-8859-{1-11,13-16}, ISO-2022-{JP,CN,KR}, EUC-JP,
 EUC-KR (aka Wangsung), EUC-CN (aka GB2312 or CN-GB).
