Description: FastMmap sessions for Catalyst
 This plugin speeds up catalyst applications by using a shared memory cache
 through an mmap'ed file. It uses fcntl locking to ensure multiple processes
 can safely access the cache at the same time. It uses a basic LRU algorithm to
 keep the most used entries in the cache.
