Package: libgee-dev
Priority: optional
Section: libdevel
Installed-Size: 136
Maintainer: Maintainers of Vala packages <pkg-vala-maintainers@lists.alioth.debian.org>
Architecture: i386
Source: libgee
Version: 0.1.3-1
Depends: libgee0 (= 0.1.3-1), libglib2.0-dev (>= 2.10.0)
Filename: pool/main/libg/libgee/libgee-dev_0.1.3-1_i386.deb
Size: 9210
MD5sum: 92e6d94d038040b7da4f8d604dab4751
SHA1: 50e6c403e1677a611c9f6cddff4b6724c29df5e2
SHA256: 84ced1032b3d11cba60304f83c70692f38e696c436a7407c34c6357d1151dfe8
Description: GObject based collection library (development files)
 libgee is a collection library providing GObject-based interfaces and
 classes for commonly used data structures.
 .
 libgee provides the following interfaces:
  * Iterable
   * Collection
    * List
    * Set
  * Iterator
  * Map
 .
 The ArrayList, HashSet, and HashMap classes provide a reasonable sample
 implementation of the List, Set, and Map interfaces. ReadOnlyCollection,
 ReadOnlyList, ReadOnlySet, and ReadOnlyMap are read-only wrapper classes
 that prevent modification of the underlying collection.
 .
 libgee is written in Vala and can be used like any GObject-based C library.
 It's planned to provide bindings for further languages.
 .
 This package contains the headers and development libraries.
Homepage: http://live.gnome.org/Vala
Tag: devel::library

