Architecture: all
Source: libgenerics
Version: 1.2.1-3
Filename: pool/main/libg/libgenerics/libgenerics-docs_1.2.1-3_all.deb
Size: 27982
MD5sum: 13f9b805bea33e48751c5feaa94519b8
SHA1: 6bd44a9e139bec201466e293e6d2c0a48db6d9c0
SHA256: 1a9a8ee801f6b81683e54012780632c7f4a5ef0c9e8bd14418865c9a3cd38e58
Description: general c++ utility library - documentation
 Libgenerics is a general c++ utility library. Its main purpose is to give
 developers a set of tools that enable them to describe the objects they are
 developing at compile time to dynamically analyse them at runtime. It gives the
 possibility to dump and restore the objects states in a binary chunk or xml
 format way too.
 .
 Libgenerics introduces the following notions:
  * metaclasses handling,
  * serialization process definition,
  * a small xml object layer,
  * object listener abstraction,
  * API-signed dynamic module load / link capabilities.
 .
 This package contains the development headers and static libraries.
Homepage: http://libgenerics.sourceforge.net/
Tag: devel::doc, devel::lang:c++, made-of::html, role::documentation

