Description: Global in memory Haskell state with ACID guarantees
 HAppS is a Haskell library for building Internet applications.
 .
 This library allows restarting and having the app recover to exactly
 where it left off in case of system crashes. HAppS-State spares from
 the need from deal with all the marshalling, consistency, and
 configuration headache that using an external DBMS for this purpose
