Package: liblog4j1.2-java
Priority: optional
Section: libs
Installed-Size: 384
Maintainer: Debian Java Maintainers <pkg-java-maintainers@lists.alioth.debian.org>
Architecture: all
Source: jakarta-log4j
Version: 1.2.15-4
Depends: java-common, default-jre-headless | java2-runtime-headless | java1-runtime-headless | java2-runtime | java1-runtime
Recommends: liblog4j1.2-java-gcj
