Description: Program cache utility module for the Roxen Challenger web server
 This is an 'utility' script, which will help you manage your programs
 cache. It is useful especially when you're developing some pikescript
 or module. In that case, if your scripts inherits inherit from some
 other pike program, and you want to change the parent program, the
 cached version will be used, thus getting in the way. This pikescript
 will help you manage the programs cache selectively deleting those
 entries that get in your way.
Tag: devel::library, interface::daemon, network::server, suite::roxen

