Installed-Size: 1224
Maintainer: Alastair McKinstry <mckinstry@debian.org>
Architecture: i386
Source: slang2
Version: 2.1.3-3
Depends: libc6-dev | libc-dev, libpng-dev, libslang2 (= 2.1.3-3)
