Description: Direct Perl interface to WordNet database
 This package provides a direct interface to the WordNet database
 files. It allows the user direct access to the full WordNet semantic
 lexicon. All parts of speech are supported and access is generally
 very efficient because the index and morphical exclusion tables are
 loaded at initialization. This initialization step is slow
 (appx. 10-15 seconds), but queries are very fast
 thereafter---thousands of queries can be completed every second.
Homepage: http://search.cpan.org/dist/WordNet-QueryData/

