Depends: python (>= 2.4), python-qt3, python-kde3, python-mutagen, python-gst0.10, gstreamer0.10-alsa | gstreamer0.10-audiosink, gstreamer0.10-plugins-base, gstreamer0.10-plugins-good, gstreamer0.10-plugins-ugly
