Description: Gather data about network devices and connected nodes
 Netdisco is an Open Source web-based network management
 tool designed for moderate-large networks. Using SNMP it
 locates the switch port of an end-user system by IP or MAC
 address. Layer2 topology discovery via CDP. Device inventory
 by OS/model + more.
 .
