Package: pngquant
Priority: optional
Section: graphics
Installed-Size: 80
Maintainer: Nelson A. de Oliveira <naoliv@debian.org>
Architecture: i386
Version: 1.0-4
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.7-1), libpng12-0 (>= 1.2.13-4), zlib1g (>= 1:1.1.4)
