Installed-Size: 5500
Maintainer: Debian QA Group <packages@qa.debian.org>
Architecture: i386
Version: 2.1-6
Depends: libc-client2007b, libc6 (>= 2.7-1), libdb4.6, libgcc1 (>= 1:4.1.1), libkrb53 (>= 1.6.dfsg.2), libldap-2.4-2 (>= 2.4.7), libstdc++6 (>= 4.1.1), adduser
