Description: Tiny but powerful program to make animated presentations
 Pyslide allows you to make presentations with text, images and shapes, loads
 different fonts from TTF files, animate them and make a variety of alpha
 effects.
 .
 There is a brief description of the syntax in the README file and some examples
 in the distribution, where all the features are shown.
 .
 It is written in Python and uses SDL (through pygame), the presentations are
 created in an XML file and can be compiled into Python code.
 .
 You need the Python Image Library to export the presentation to static web
 pages.
