Installed-Size: 1788
Maintainer: Piotr Ożarowski <piotr@debian.org>
Architecture: all
Source: sqlalchemy
Version: 0.4.7p1-2
Replaces: python2.4-sqlalchemy (<< 0.2.3-0.1)
