 cite the following reference:
 .
 Galtier, N., Gouy, M. and Gautier, C. (1996) "SeaView and
 Phylo_win, two graphic tools for sequence alignment and molecular
 phylogeny." Comput. Applic. Biosci. 12:543-548.
