 display all the tags that are in them and jump to those tags.  You
 can also expand multiple directories into your speedbar frame.  It
 supports file/directory trees, Info manuals, EIEIO class browsing,
 project browsing, context analysis/autocomplete, EIRC groups, xshtml,
 and VHDL. It can be rigged to display just about anything.
 .
