Package: tdiary
Priority: optional
Section: web
Installed-Size: 1068
Maintainer: Daigo Moriwaki <daigo@debian.org>
Architecture: all
Version: 2.2.1-1
Depends: ruby (>= 1.8), libuconv-ruby1.8, rdtool, libdpkg-ruby1.8
Recommends: tdiary-theme (= 2.2.1-1), tdiary-plugin (= 2.2.1-1)
