Package: therion
Priority: extra
Section: science
Installed-Size: 3620
Maintainer: Wookey <wookey@debian.org>
Architecture: i386
Version: 0.5.1+nmu1
Depends: bwidget, libc6 (>= 2.7-1), libgcc1 (>= 1:4.1.1-21), libstdc++6 (>= 4.2.1-4), tcl8.4 | wish, texlive-base, texlive-metapost
