Filename: pool/main/l/linux-modules-extra-2.6/tp-smapi-modules-2.6-486_2.6.26-6_i386.deb
Size: 4722
MD5sum: 86970297da72caefa2c7cff0e47821a6
SHA1: 5c677b3031d10554ab12b50fce22d159314280f9
SHA256: 02e52740eb13e966e52f582c6564f7187743b5274ad1ab968b4290116e2f8873
Description: ThinkPad hardware/firmware access for Linux 2.6 on x86
 This package depends on the ThinkPad hardware/firmware access modules for
 latest Linux kernel 2.6 on x86 and compatible machines.
 .
 The tp_smapi kernel module exposes some features of the ThinkPad
 hardware/firmware via a sysfs interface.  Currently, the main implemented
 functionality is control of battery charging and extended battery status.
 The underlying hardware interfaces are SMAPI and direct access to the
 embedded controller.
Tag: admin::{hardware,kernel,power-management}, hardware::laptop, hardware::power, implemented-in::c, role::dummy, role::kernel

