SHA256: bea13e74020ce4ef9fda5adc40e9750616b329719d835faf22bac2a8ed780c2b
Description: A TrueType font with Mongolian Cyrillic letters
 Arhangai is a Sans Serif font.  It has no slanted nore bold variants.
 It supports the Mongolian Cyrillic alphabet but can be used for all
 languages whose alphabet is a subset of the Mongolian alphabet (most
 notably Bulgarian and Russian).  It can be useful also for ASCII
 languages such as English.
 .
 Please notice, that in place of Latin1 symbols this font contains
 Mongolian characters.  You can not use this font if you need
 non-ASCII Latin characters.
Tag: culture::mongolian, made-of::font, role::{app-data,content:font,data}
Task: cyrillic-desktop

